Date: 2026-10-13. No provider key; no model run possible.

## Commands + trimmed output

$ POST /api/session {"title":"q",...} -> HTTP 200, body includes:
{"data":{"id":"ses_...","cost":0,
  "tokens":{"input":0,"output":0,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"read":0,"write":0}},...}}
$ GET /api/session/<id> -> same cost 0 + zeroed tokens (HTTP 200)

Source: openapi Session.Info requires ["id","projectID","cost","tokens","time","location"].

## Observation
The fields EXIST and are reported (cost 0, all token counters 0 before any
model run). Whether they fill in correctly for AGENCY_MODEL after a real
run is untested — no key, no model id.

## Verdict: NOT PERFORMED (no provider key; pre-run zero values observed)
